  "description": "# Summary\n\n1. **Initial Request**: Created a Chrome DevTools-style notification control component for the status bar that displays notification counts for info, warning, and error types.\n\n2. **Component Features**: The control includes a clickable button panel that opens above the status bar showing filtered notifications by type, with timestamps, removal functionality, and a \"Clear All\" button.\n\n3. **Integration**: Integrated NotificationControl.vue into the existing EventBar.vue component alongside the last event display.\n\n4. **Store Connection**: Connected the component to the session store to access and manage notifications through Vuex actions.\n\n5. **Header Color Enhancement**: Updated the notification panel header to display dynamic colors based on notification type (blue for info, orange for warning, red for error) for better visual distinction.",
